  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Carnival 2011 was held at Mydome Osaka on 5 and 6 November and at Sunshine City in Tokyo on 19 and 20 November 2011; with the spring season called off after the March earthquake, they were the only Battle Carnivals that year. Its main tournament, the Victory Cup, had an A League for elementary school children and younger, a B League for junior high school students and older, and an Open League for all ages. After the Challenge and Premier stages, the Climax Stage was played best of three, and its top three in each league won Victory Cup in the print for their place, Champion, 2nd Place or 3rd Place: only six copies of each, by Pokumon's count. Everyone in the Challenge Stage got reverse holo Sandile and Krokorok stamped with the event's logo.",
